[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i407"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"船已经改造得差不多了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"生锈的固定件和部件，全都换成了新的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"船体重新刷得很漂亮，破烂的绳子也被重新拉上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一点点，一点点地……朝着完工那天接近。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对我来说，这其实也感觉有点寂寞。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其实，我是想和鸥一起这样整顿船只的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就这么完工的话……总感觉，有什么就会结束了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以，当我看着渐渐完成的船而感到欣喜的同时，也会有一丝遗憾。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这时候，背后传来了脚步声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“你好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"意料之外的人物站在那里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鹭阿姨……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“……啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"来到海湾的鹭阿姨，停下了脚步。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“这是。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她惊讶地瞪大双眼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“你真的将它完成了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，目前还没有完工。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但是我想这个月应该可以完成。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鹭阿姨呆呆地看了一会船。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“……谢谢你。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“直到2年前，我都和那孩子两个人一起……在这里改造这艘船。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“还准备了谜题和钥匙。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“非常开心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“说不定也是受到那个孩子的影响，我也变得童心大发。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“总有一天一定要叫上大家，让他们看看这艘船。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“那孩子对这件事真的非常非常期待。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鹭阿姨忽然捂住嘴低下了头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“对不起。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1275"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“鸥她……已经很长一段时间几乎都在睡梦中度过了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“然后，我有一件事情没告诉你。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“在这个夏天之前。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“鸥就已经一睡不醒了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1278"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“听我说。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我是来道别的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我必须得走了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i407"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“所以我才会在这个夏天，来到这座岛上。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“这是我和那孩子的约定。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“她说最后想再去一次那座岛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“所以……我……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“独自一人来到岛上……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“然后遇到了你。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“你为了完成这艘船而这么努力。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“不仅仅是我，那孩子也一定会很开心的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“可能的话，我也想看着这艘船完成。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那，个……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“我差不多该回去了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“其实我烦恼了很久，到底要不要来这座岛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“但光是遇到你，就足以让我相信这是个正确的决定。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“所以……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“谢谢你了。鹰原。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“请等一下。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……我。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这个夏天。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我一直和鸥在一起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“唉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我们之前就认识是谎话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“其实是在这个夏天才相遇的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我和她，一直都在一起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是真的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1051"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我们待在一起，走在一起，一起说话……一起度过每天。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i219"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10977"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“和她一起寻找钥匙……”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i296"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11065"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在洞窟中探险。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i294"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11003"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“一起经历了您和她所准备的冒险。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i407"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在说这些话的同时，连我自己都搞不懂了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥现在人在国外。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不在这座岛上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但我确确实实曾经和她在一起。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说不定别人会觉得我脑子坏了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可我不在意。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我觉得必须要告诉她事实真相。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我很开心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“非常，非常开心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以……”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1285"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“谢谢这个词，应该是由我来说。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“想要对她说。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“把我的心情告诉她……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“想要把船做好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“想给她看。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我一定是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喜欢上她了吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i407"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“是吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“听上去确实很不可思议。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“但总觉得，好像很多事情都能说得通了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“一定是这样的吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“那孩子虽然身体虚弱。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“但是一旦决定要做什么事，就一定会做到底。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“所以。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1275"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“她一定……实现了梦想吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“朋友也好，探险的回忆也好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“都只能从书本中获得的那孩子。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“若是获得了真正的回忆。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“那就太好了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“太好了啊，鸥……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“鸥……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“请让我以她母亲的身份向你致谢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鹭","text":"“真的很感谢你。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i743"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回过神来，我已经到了港口。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“喂。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11728"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“鹰原，你要的修船用的材料，今天似乎就能送到了哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……是吗，谢谢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“怎么了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什么怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11712"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“因为你……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11721"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不，没什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我没事的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11728"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我知道了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i363"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥陷入了沉睡。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在远方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"独自一人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一睡不醒。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"追逐着梦想，化为了梦想的一部分。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后……就那样，在梦想的尽头……消失了吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"再也见不到了吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果是这样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我所做的事究竟是为了什么，为了谁呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"强烈的无力感袭来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我到底在做些什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"到底该怎么做。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"鸥她……又会怎么样呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"‘为了大家。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了不知道会不会来的大家，鸥努力了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她说，因为约定好了……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这么一来我也得做到最后了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了鸥重要的伙伴们。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其中也包括我自己。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]